{"id":"ru_ckga_ngig","lemma":"rückgängig","pos":"adj","rank":3911,"glosses":["retrogressive"],"ipa":"/ˈʁʏkˌɡɛŋɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b3/De-r%C3%BCckg%C3%A4ngig.ogg/De-r%C3%BCckg%C3%A4ngig.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wir müssen rückgängig machen, was geschehen ist.","en":"We have to undo what was done.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},null,{"g":"to make"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"to occur"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Was geschehen ist, kann man nicht rückgängig machen.","en":"What happened can't be undone.","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to occur"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Die Änderungen, die wir vorgenommen haben, sind nicht mehr rückgängig zu machen.","en":"The changes we made are irreversible.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"change, modification","l":"Änderung"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to undertake","l":"vornehmen"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to make"}]}]}